15%，年減6.63%，前10月營收507.05億元，年增1.03%，大立光11月的出貨動能預估將較10月減少。","sentiment":-1,"tags":{"topics":["訂單/接單","EPS/獲利","營收","擴產/資本支出","法說/展望","法人動向"],"bull":["出貨","年增"],"bear":["下滑","減少","年減","延後"],"score":-2,"highlights":["年增8.34%","年增1%","年增1.03%"],"keywords":["大立光","玉晶光","光學","營收","私募","3M"]},"time":"11/06 17:23"},{"id":"600571b28fb46987","source":"FTNN 新聞網","category":"台股","title":"台股暴殺逾2100點！大立光也扛不住跌逾4％ 10月營收創近一年新高卻爆11月警訊","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTE9TWU5uWTI4czV3dVUxLVg5bWpyQzIxLWZPcU9jQktjLUlsRjl3amFzc3g5YXhGbXlhSVlxbzR4bU55dEpwMmdibVJVRQ?oc=5","published":1793954460,"summary":"台股暴殺逾2100點！大立光也扛不住跌逾4％ 10月營收創近一年新高卻爆11月警訊 FTNN 新聞網","sentiment":0,"tags":{"topics":["營收"],"bull":["新高","營收創"],"bear":["警訊"],"score":1,"highlights":[],"keywords":[]},"time":"11/06 16:41"},{"id":"e33175788a9d3ca5","source":"TVBS新聞網","category":"台股","title":"台股失守4萬點引中長線買盤 聯發科大立光抗跌、非AI板塊成資金避風港","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTFBUcnJsNV81R3JjaGZZWVgteFpRRDBkMnd3Zks1ZTU4Q29jVXMyT1lCazZGSjQ5ejhpd0haZXJYRnR6ZzVIY0tHWE1yNHVnNDA?oc=5","published":1793947440,"summary":"台股失守4萬點引中長線買盤 聯發科大立光抗跌、非AI板塊成資金避風港 TVBS新聞網","sentiment":-1,"tags":{"topics":["AI/半導體"],"bull":[],"bear":["失守"],"score":-2,"highlights":[],"keywords":[]},"time":"11/06 14:44"},{"id":"a2b4630495b5b1ff","source":"富聯網","category":"台股","title":"盤後分析：台股史詩級暴跌後拉升，聯發科、大立光率先展現抗跌力","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxNRW03bjg2OXViMVdCVDBSaDlrU2hWRTlrRTdZbjA4Wm55WVV2UTBZcV9Ga1F4NUxfRnp3anc5ZllQeUdlbG1aWFFWOXRQMmFzanRuLXRGdzNqdGJCbVlCYlp1SmItb1EycHVSWG9ITm9tbjM1dm5yaTRxWXJ6R0VJUVBSVnRVX1h0?oc=5","published":1793946840,"summary":"盤後分析：台股史詩級暴跌後拉升，聯發科、大立光率先展現抗跌力 富聯網","sentiment":-1,"tags":{"topics":["盤後"],"bull":[],"bear":["暴跌"],"score":-3,"highlights":[],"keywords":[]},"time":"11/06 14:34"}],"fund":{"code":"3008","rev_month":"11510","rev":5845633.0,"rev_mom":1.1498865150222894,"rev_yoy":-7.047648941801592,"rev_cum_yoy":0.9701562367048676,"eps_q":121.98,"eps_year":"115","eps_se